OL,3,GNEWSACyclist fighting for life after
OL,4,Abeing hit by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has suffered life-threatening
OL,7,Finjuries after being hit by a bus in
OL,8,FManchester city centre.
OL,10,FThe man, aged in his 80s, was struck on
OL,11,FDeansgate, at the junction with Bridge
OL,12,FStreet, at about 12:30 GMT.
OL,14,FGreater Manchester Police said he was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital, where he remains in
OL,16,Fa critical condition.
OL,18,FNo arrests have been made.
